    "agency": {
      "description": "<p><strong>10x WA Hub is a multi-number WhatsApp communication, CRM automation, and calling platform built for teams that manage sales, support, customer engagement, and follow-up workflows.</strong></p><p>Connect multiple WhatsApp business numbers to one organized workspace while keeping every conversation routed through the correct number and team.</p><p>The platform helps teams manage WhatsApp messaging, shared inbox conversations, customer assignments, notes, tags, automation workflows, approved message templates, media, message delivery tracking, and calling workflows from a structured CRM environment.</p><p>Each WhatsApp number can be assigned to a specific purpose such as Sales, Support, Orders, or Customer Success, helping teams maintain clear communication without mixing customer conversations across business numbers.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities include:</strong><br />• Multi-number WhatsApp management<br />• Shared team inbox and conversation routing<br />• CRM and workflow automation<br />• Sales and support communication<br />• Messaging templates and media handling<br />• Message status tracking<br />• Team assignments, notes, and tags<br />• Customer communication and calling workflows<br />• Secure workspace-based access and routing</p><p>10x WA Hub is designed for agencies, consultants, sales teams, support teams, and businesses that need a scalable way to manage customer communication across multiple WhatsApp numbers.</p>",
      "previewImageUrls": [
        "https://msgsndr-private.storage.googleapis.com/marketplace/apps/6a4f5223a88da74ae658dba7/e00cb1af-e84a-44f6-a9b9-6c3cc3b0f759.png",
